Hi all,

A preview of OpenVPN 2.3-alpha1 installer for Windows is now available here:

<http://build.openvpn.net/downloads/snapshots/openvpn-2.3-alpha1-preview1-i=
nstall.exe>

It's essentially the same as the to-be 2.3-alpha1, except that

- the installer is not signed
- the new OpenVPN-GUI is not signed

The TAP-driver _is_ signed, so it  should install just fine on Windows
Vista/7. The official 2-3-alpha1 release will follow as soon as
signatures are taken care of. Hopefully this happens later today or some
time tomorrow.

A full list of changes is available here:

<http://pastebin.com/raw.php?i=3D6EPqp7y5>

Any help in testing this before release is _much_ appreciated!

